          "I tried Capnos first &mdash; the throat hit was good but I couldn&rsquo;t get the flavor to stay on the wick. Switched to Lio and the core system just works. Plus the wood device makes me actually want to pick it up."
          <span class="lio-lp-vs__quote-author">— Verified customer, switched from Capnos</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lio-lp-vs__quote">
          "Got Ripple+ thinking it would help me quit vaping. Turns out I was just vaping a different flavor. Switched to Lio four months ago &mdash; haven&rsquo;t reached for a real vape since."
          <span class="lio-lp-vs__quote-author">— Verified customer, switched from Ripple+</span>
